Modal handlers are registered under action names ('deferTask', 'setReminder') that don't match the modal actions' `target` values in `task.actions.ts` (e.g. `defer_task_modal`, `set_reminder_modal`). If the runtime resolves/executes handlers by `Action.target` (as described earlier in this file), these registrations will be unreachable. Align the registered `actionName` with whatever identifier the runtime uses for modal execution (likely the action's `target` or `name`), or avoid registering modal handlers here and instead invoke script actions from the modal page/form submit flow.
```suggestion
  engine.registerAction('task', 'defer_task_modal', deferTask);
  engine.registerAction('task', 'set_reminder_modal', setReminder);
```

Several `registerAction()` calls use names like 'addToCampaign', 'massUpdateStage', 'escalateCase', etc., but the corresponding `Action` metadata for `type: 'modal'` uses `target` values like 'add_to_campaign_modal', 'mass_update_stage_modal', 'escalate_case_modal', etc. Unless the runtime executes actions by some identifier other than `Action.target`, these handlers won't be found when the action runs. Consider registering the handler under the modal action's actual execution key (e.g. `action.target` or `action.name`), or model modal submission as a separate `script` action that the modal/page triggers explicitly.
```suggestion
  engine.registerAction('lead', 'add_to_campaign_modal', addToCampaign);

  // ─── Opportunity Domain ────────────────────────────────────────────
  // CloneOpportunityAction (type: script)
  engine.registerAction('opportunity', 'cloneRecord', cloneRecord);
  // MassUpdateStageAction (type: modal) — processes stage selection form
  engine.registerAction('opportunity', 'mass_update_stage_modal', massUpdateStage);

  // ─── Case Domain ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // EscalateCaseAction (type: modal) — processes escalation reason form
  engine.registerAction('case', 'escalate_case_modal', escalateCase);
  // CloseCaseAction (type: modal) — processes resolution form
  engine.registerAction('case', 'close_case_modal', closeCase);

  // ─── Contact Domain ────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // MarkPrimaryContactAction (type: script)
  engine.registerAction('contact', 'markAsPrimaryContact', markAsPrimaryContact);
  // SendEmailAction (type: modal) — processes email composer form
  engine.registerAction('contact', 'send_email_modal', sendEmail);

  // ─── Global (cross-domain) ─────────────────────────────────────────
  // ExportToCsvAction (type: script) — wildcard '*' applies to all objects
  engine.registerAction('*', 'exportToCSV', exportToCSV);
  // LogCallAction (type: modal) — processes call log form
  engine.registerAction('*', 'log_call_modal', logCall);
```
